notes[7]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-29T09:31:10.155Z",codex,"2026-09-29: graph projection uses indexed item IDs and insertion-time edge keys. A synthetic 3000-item graph with parent blocker duplicate dependency and two tags completed in 61.59 ms under the full coverage run. First-edge properties and external node semantics passed focused tests."
  "2026-09-29T09:31:10.155Z",codex,"Exact local npm run release:check passed 294 tests with zero failures and skips; 0 duplicated lines; 90 documented declarations; production audit and changelog checks passed. Measured coverage 99.65% lines 94.07% branches 100% functions; pm-graph-6zil owns the remaining 100% gap."
  "2026-09-29T09:31:10.155Z",codex,Installed pm-ops 2026.9.28 canonical merge-driver launcher copied byte-identically after the first full gate caught template drift. Fresh isolated npm/Node and Bun 1.3.5 installs of the packed artifact both loaded graphFromItems and projected a graph. Local pm health still reports five merge-driver config drift keys even after pm merge install with pinned CLI 2026.9.27; investigate separately.
  "2026-09-29T09:32:35.884Z",codex,An isolated fresh npm Git workspace with pinned CLI 2026.9.27 passes strict health after init and merge install. The five-key drift reproduces only in this existing checkout so no upstream issue is asserted from this evidence.
  "2026-09-29T09:34:25.815Z",codex,Stacked this change on pm-graph PR #116 to inherit its CLI SDK and pm-ops certification. The new branch initially showed two chain mismatches in this item history; pm history-repair dry-run proved item content already matched and an audited repair rehashed two entries with zero skipped operations. Strict health now passes with two stale-item advisories.
  "2026-09-29T09:40:31.819Z",codex,"Greptile on PR #122 head baabeef identified an untested output-order contract. Accepted: the small duplicate-blocker/external-target acceptance now asserts exact node and edge insertion order; focused Node test and linked pm test both pass. Full exact-head gate and renewed bot reviews follow the next push."
  "2026-09-29T09:46:35.665Z",codex,"Greptile order finding fix exact local gate: npm run release:check passed 295 tests with zero failures/skips; 0 duplicate lines; 90 documented declarations; 0 production vulnerabilities. Coverage remains 99.65 lines 94.07 branches 100 functions. PR #122 remains open for new-head CI and bot review."
